# Normal tracking, mode 1000, reported in SGR-Pixels, mode 1016: the SGR form with the pointer's pixel, counted from 1, in place of its cell.
# Each button is pressed and released over a cell, the wheel steps up and
# down, Shift, Alt and Ctrl are held over a press, and a move with no
# button held is not reported in this mode.
# spec: ctlseqs, Mouse Tracking
# covers: DEC-1016
size 20 5
send "\e[?1000h"
send "\e[?1016h"
send "\e[?1016$p"
mouse press left at 1,0 px=11,5
mouse release left at 1,0 px=11,5
mouse press middle at 2,1 px=19,21
mouse release middle at 2,1 px=19,21
mouse press right at 3,2 px=27,37
mouse release right at 3,2 px=27,37
wheel up at 4,3 px=35,53
wheel down at 4,3 px=35,53
mouse press left at 5,4 px=43,69 mods=shift
mouse release left at 5,4 px=43,69 mods=shift
mouse press left at 6,4 px=51,69 mods=alt
mouse release left at 6,4 px=51,69 mods=alt
mouse press left at 7,4 px=59,69 mods=ctrl
mouse release left at 7,4 px=59,69 mods=ctrl
wheel down at 8,4 px=67,69 mods=ctrl
mouse move at 9,4 px=75,69
send "\e[?1000l"
mouse press left at 1,0
